    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "From your suggestions to Theresis's future, none of it holds our interest."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "To us, it is no more than passing the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "Why do we hold affection for these things that pass in the blink of an eye?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "We've exhausted practically every possibility, and practically every delight too."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "I'm beginning to pity you, Damazti."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "You've found out we're just some old decrepit nothing gets to anymore, no matter how loud you shout it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "Not many know this secret."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "A few friends of mine taught me this silly game..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Logos",
        "text": "No, never mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "Go on, Banshee. We're more interested than you suppose."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "But\u2014you may have to wait a moment. Some bothersome work has come a-knocking."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_426_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster",
        "text": "Not here, that is, but I'm afraid we'll need to divert a little attention."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
