    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
            "key": "$darkness02_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "What do you mean... not there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "I mean it's not there, for god's sakes!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "The comms post isn't there! There's nothing there! Someone's made off with it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Was it the Dublinn forces?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "Afraid it was long before that. Judging from how thick the dust was, someone must've been eyeing it when Norport was just setting course away from Londinium."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Trilby Asher",
        "text": "The Redsteel Guard captain would never genuinely be fooled by us. He'd be very quick to realize the projected message was never sent."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_867_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Trilby Asher",
        "text": "But at the very least, we're back at the same starting line. We have a renewed opportunity to go for the gold."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "First there was you for the Duke of Caster, now there's Dublinn's spectre force..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "You've all secretly infiltrated to get onto this plate, which means, you want to keep up Norport's surface appearances."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "Without any way to force the dukes' main armies into mobilizing, our plan's dead in the water."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Never try that excuse again, Delphine."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "As long as your duke mother learns you're still here, she'll find some way to save you, won't she."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Delphine",
        "text": "I can't guarantee..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Admitting you get along with your mother is nothing to be ashamed of."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Do you have an idea, Ines?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "What a pain in the ass."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Looks like you can do it.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...I really hate that part of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#13$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But alright. I can try."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I need high elevation. Don't get your hopes up."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#15$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Miss Ines, how much time will your idea need?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Until sunup."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Tell Siege and her city friends to get ready."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "May I wish you all godspeed, and I look forward to you choosing the Sunset Street Hotel again."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "I've spent some wonderful times here, and gotten to know some very fine people."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#2$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Norport is a lovely, thriving place. Don't let it be reduced to memories and rubble like this."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We promise, sir."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "There'll come an end to the conspiracy and dispute."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "There's... a person I truly, truly miss, who once told me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That perhaps, one day... everyone on this vast land can fall into peaceful slumber."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "*sigh* There's a back-breaker. This hotel's even messier than it was before."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "People who don't do their own cleaning never know how difficult it is to maintain a bit of order."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Percival! Percival!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Where's she run off to now..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Fine, go and leave this old codger by himself for a bit."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The age-riddled hotel owner finds an equally age-riddled armchair, and opts to find a comfortable position before sitting down."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "So that... Cautus girl, she's the King of Sarkaz?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "It's getting harder and harder to keep up with all this change. Even I'm a little shocked by it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Change... change. Maybe I've been slacking on that sort of change myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Change isn't progress, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Alright, about time I bid farewell to this old friend. To tell the truth... I really did love this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "*sigh*... Two more months you should've kept this up, Colbert. Who would've imagined, after two months of the Sarkaz army in the city, an old devil would go from cleaner to hotel owner."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "I just can't wrap my head around it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The elderly Sarkaz stands up, and scans over the grand lobby of the public house. Every single article in here is near and dear to him."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "That Ines Caprinae says war doesn't do metaphor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_865_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Colbert",
        "text": "Well, then. Let's restore its original looks."
    },
    {
