    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "The... The soldiers here, were they all killed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "Is the enemy here?! If I'd found this earlier..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Their families will receive compensation payouts. If they have families."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "We have to be on guard..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#8$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "Do you look like that... because you already knew about this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#9$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "You... This was part of your plan too..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "It was per Military Commission of Kazdel arrangements."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Sacrifice is unavoidable, mercenary. I thought your captain would have taught you this long ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "You're a general! And they're your soldiers!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Yes. I am a general, and this is my work."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Be it our enemies or ourselves, I must cast each and every life into this gaping maw we call war\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "And pray it spits out the best ending we could wish for."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "That is all I can achieve in my position."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "You\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Hence why I came; I came to give this all my full attention. To look over every pale, young face here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "I must remind myself that this was a decision I made."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "I will not say this is the price the Sarkaz must pay, mercenary."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "The Victorians killed them, but it was I that let them be killed by the Victorians."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4071_peper_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Paprika",
        "text": "Why do you have to do it this way?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "To light a fire."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Manfred",
        "text": "Light a fire that will extend across this great land."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
